-- parity_exempt --
reason: structured-metadata-unobservable
detail: seed populates LogAttributes ({'query_kind':'Select'}), which upstream's in-process querier discards before the pipeline runs, so `sum by (query_kind) (count_over_time({service_name="clickhouse"}[5m]))` would be answered over different data on the two sides
